# Firearms Training & Concealed Carry Classes in Fairfax, VA

## NRA Certified Firearms Training for All Skill Levels
At Live Fire Instruction, we pride ourselves on delivering the highest quality firearms training in Northern Virginia. Our NRA certified instructors are dedicated to helping every student—from first-time gun owners to experienced shooters—master the fundamentals of marksmanship and safety.

### Beginner Pistol Courses in Fairfax
Our beginner courses are designed to build a solid foundation. We cover everything from the basic parts of a handgun to proper grip, stance, and trigger control, ensuring you feel confident the first time you step onto the range. See our [NRA Basic Pistol Course](/nra-basic-pistol-course-fairfax-va) for more details.

### Intermediate to Advanced Live Fire Instruction
For those looking to sharpen their skills, our advanced training sessions focus on defensive shooting techniques, shooting under stress, and improving speed and accuracy during live fire drills. Explore our [advanced pistol courses](/nra-defensive-pistol-course).

### One-on-One Private Firearms Training
Looking for personalized attention? Our private instruction sessions allow you to work directly with an expert trainer to address your specific goals and progress at your own pace. Learn more about [one-on-one training](/private-shooting-lessons-northern-va).

## Get Your Virginia Concealed Carry Permit (CCW)
Obtaining your Virginia Concealed Handgun Permit (CHP) is a serious responsibility. We provide the comprehensive training required to apply for your permit with confidence.

### Virginia CCW Class Requirements
To get your permit, you must demonstrate handgun competency. Our in-person classes meet all state requirements for [concealed carry training](/blog/how-to-obtain-your-virginia-carry-permit-from-live-fire-instruction-fairfax-va) in Fairfax and Northern Virginia.

### What You’ll Learn in Our Concealed Carry Course
Beyond the basics, our CCW classes cover Virginia gun laws, safe storage, situational awareness, and the legalities of using a firearm for self-defense.

### Reciprocity – Carry Legally Across State Lines
We’ll guide you through the states that recognize the Virginia concealed carry permit, helping you understand where you can legally carry when traveling outside of the Commonwealth.

